Z||000007||Phil||05-12-2000||03:34 PM||||I really have a problem with 27.5% loss. I agree with gixxer much closer to 15-20% loss.  My SC3800 is supposed to put out about 275 hp  the chasis dyno gives 222 (standard tranny) someone else had their N* ( auto tranny and not in a Fiero) on the dyno and he got 236 from a 300hp rated motor. These figures are just about a 20%loss. 222/.8 =277.5   236/.8 =295. Using 27.5% would give me 306  and the N* 325.5  I don't think so.   ||||reg||1
